   "**A protected building whose status is certified by each belligerent for itself has no protected status at all** — the IDF says command centre, Hamas says war crime, and no press, no ICRC access and no third-party forensic team can adjudicate; the direct effect is that the strike's legality is decided in press releases; the compound consequence is that the legal category decays through repetition — after the third or fourth hospital, \"protected\" stops describing a building and starts describing a claim, and the side that can produce the most documentation wins an argument the law was meant to settle by fact",
